(text "MANUAL TESTS: SW9000 SELECT = 1/2/3 presses in a fixed 3-second window; SW9001 STEP holds each condition until pressed. TEST_ACTIVE flashes 1/2/3 Hz while CELL / DC / 1-20kHz is active. Extra STEP after final R condition completes; SELECT hold 2s cancels. XLR stays muted. GPIOs use SoM V18; indicator current comes only from V12SOM, not analog rails." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.000 18.000 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "9229089a-ac81-4ac7-aad6-20a2dd657713"))
(text "Rail LEDs: rough presence only, nominal ~500uA using Vf~1.8V. No precision references or bias nodes loaded. Mount each indicator near its named supply/entry; GND_AP stays isolated. Series current resistor can be removed for diagnostic comparison. V18 indication is buffered from V12SOM because 1.8V cannot guarantee red-LED headroom; brightness is not a voltage limit check. VAP18/VAP09 carry no LEDs (user ruling) - probe them on the AP-sheet TP bank instead." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.000 115.000 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "16779e66-9af2-4212-8409-6940d130dde2"))
